  "consumerScope": "AST提取实际extractNodeInfo/handleMessage/handleInterrupt/handleFlowStop/handleMessageEnd，在Node VM执行；UI/store渲染与setNode细节用显式spy，不计页面检查",
  "adapterRecommendations": [
    "node.started/delta/completed/failed只投choice.finish_reason=null；node.finish_reason依node事件nullable/stop，不能将node完成变flow stop",
    "checkpoint必须关联已授权当前run/lease/attempt/固定node的中心真实question和revision；原event_data.value.type/content/option与need_reply不能从任意Worker字符串信任",
    "center run.completed/failed/cancelled持久终态才投choice.stop；失败/取消code非0且safe message，usage/executedTime从中心已确认记录读取",
    "恢复原DTO已声明nullable字段供旧UI严格null，不更改canonical/event/model原帧或猜填未知输出",
    "原error-only code/message会被旧UI忽略；无授权terminal不能包装成成功/stop，可以HTTP拒绝或由真实失败结果投安全终帧",
    "原option点击的是interrupt.id，即原QA配置name，不是配置UUID id；default由原UI过滤",
    "缺合法legacyFrame的reasoning.delta不能直接泛化完整模型SSE；同text.delta内reasoning与下一reasoning.delta可能重复，应建立可核对关联"
  ],
